/// See [setAudioSources] for a detailed explanation of the options.␀␀␀À␀}fÀ␀}fÀ␀}m␀␀␀À␀}}À␀}}À␀}‡␀␀␀À␀}œÀ␀}œÀ␀}¡␀␀␀À␀}µÀ␀}µÀ␀}½␀À␀}«À␀{¶À␀{¶‚À␀}Uv/// Convenience method to set the audio source to a file, preloaded by
/// default, with an initial position of zero by default.
///
/// This is equivalent to:
///
/// ```
/// setAudioSource(AudioSource.uri(Uri.file(filePath), tag: tag),
///     initialPosition: Duration.zero, preload: true);
